// perf slurinside1k (every bar a slur over 4 STACCATO notes = the heavy side of the avoid-slur #inside read: every bow has to be scored around four extra-encompass boxes, and each staff has to place its scripts once WITHOUT slurs before the bows are chosen). The @accent twin perf-slurscript1k.lys is the control: an accent is avoid-slur #around, so that book pays the gate and nothing else.
